{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12148","headline":"谷口新居寄同省朋故 · 钱起","name":"谷口新居寄同省朋故","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"种黍傍烟溪，榛芜兼沮洳。\n亦知生计薄，所贵隐身处。\n橡栗石上村，莓苔水中路。\n萧然授衣日，得此还山趣。\n汲井爱秋泉，结茅因古树。\n闲云与幽鸟，对我不能去。\n寄谢鸳鹭羣，狎鸥拙所慕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12148.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12148","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}